flowchart LR
    Patient[Patient]
    Doctor[Doctor]
    Receptionist[Receptionist]
    Administrator[Administrator]

    P1((1.0 Authentication<br/>and User Management))
    P2((2.0 Doctor and<br/>Availability Management))
    P3((3.0 Appointment<br/>Management))
    P4((4.0 Medical Records<br/>and Prescriptions))
    P5((5.0 Billing and<br/>Reporting))

    DB[(D1: PostgreSQL Database<br/>Tables: USER_ACCOUNT, role profiles,<br/>DEPARTMENT, AVAILABILITY, APPOINTMENT,<br/>MEDICAL_RECORD, PRESCRIPTION, INVOICE, AUDIT_LOG)]

    Patient -->|Credentials, profile data| P1
    P1 -->|Token, session result, access result| Patient
    Doctor -->|Credentials, availability data| P1
    P1 -->|Token, access result| Doctor
    Receptionist -->|Credentials, patient/staff data| P1
    P1 -->|Token, access result| Receptionist
    Administrator -->|Credentials, staff-management data| P1
    P1 -->|Token, access result| Administrator

    Doctor -->|Availability rules| P2
    Administrator -->|Doctor and department data| P2
    Patient -->|Doctor search request| P2
    Receptionist -->|Doctor search request| P2
    P2 -->|Available doctors and slots| Patient
    P2 -->|Availability result| Receptionist

    Patient -->|Booking or cancellation request| P3
    Receptionist -->|Patient appointment request| P3
    Doctor -->|Appointment status update| P3
    P3 -->|Appointment status and schedule| Patient
    P3 -->|Schedule and booking result| Receptionist
    P3 -->|Assigned appointment list| Doctor

    Doctor -->|Diagnosis, notes, prescriptions| P4
    Patient -->|Own-record query| P4
    P4 -->|Permitted records and prescriptions| Patient
    P4 -->|Record confirmation| Doctor

    Receptionist -->|Invoice and payment data| P5
    Administrator -->|Report request| P5
    Patient -->|Invoice query| P5
    P5 -->|Invoice and payment status| Patient
    P5 -->|Operational reports| Receptionist
    P5 -->|Dashboard and audit summary| Administrator

    P1 <--> DB
    P2 <--> DB
    P3 <--> DB
    P4 <--> DB
    P5 <--> DB

    classDef external fill:#e7f7f5,stroke:#197774,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#16484e;
    classDef process fill:#eef0ff,stroke:#6651a8,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#30265f;
    classDef datastore fill:#ffe7e7,stroke:#aa5a5a,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#672e35;
    class Patient,Doctor,Receptionist,Administrator external;
    class P1,P2,P3,P4,P5 process;
    class DB datastore;
